OL,3,GNEWSAWales to make #100 energy payments
OL,4,Abut Plaid ministers say Budget leaves
OL,5,Athem with cuts
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Welsh government has confirmed it
OL,8,Fwill make a #100 cost-of-living payment
OL,9,Fto around one million homes following
OL,10,FChancellor John Healey's Budget
OL,11,Fannouncement.
OL,13,FThe Labour chancellor had urged
OL,14,Fdevolved nations including Wales to
OL,15,Fcopy the "household energy payment" he
OL,16,Fannounced for council taxpayers in
OL,17,Fbands A-D in England.
OL,19,FHours after his speech Wales' finance
OL,20,Fminister Elin Jones said households in
OL,21,Fthe same bands in Wales would benefit.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
