OL,3,GNEWSAWales to make #100 energy payments
OL,4,Abut Plaid ministers say Budget leaves
OL,5,Athem with cuts
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut Healey's spending package led to a
OL,8,Frow over the state of funding for
OL,9,FWales' public services, with Welsh
OL,10,Ffinance minister Elin Jones saying an
OL,11,Fextra #450m over three years worked out
OL,12,Fat a "real-terms cut" because it was
OL,13,Fbelow the rate of inflation.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
